  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CFSE</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>nt</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>ne</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>nt</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Number of electrons in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;orbital</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ne</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>number of electrons in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>eg</mi></math>&nbsp;orbital.</p><p>Crystal Field&nbsp;Stabilisation Energy for the given complexes is as follows:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mstyle></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ti</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ti</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>NiF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So the correct option is B.</p>"
